            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HMG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good and the only thing I did different was use all vegan butter, no shortening. It was a really nice compliment to my spice cupcakes (also vegan), but like any caramel buttercream, it's really really sweet. Too sweet for some. Hard to get around that - you really do need all the powdered sugar for consistency, that is if you want to actually frost and not drizzle. Overall very good though, and no one other than the actual vegans knew it was vegan!",
            "datePublished": "2015-02-17T05:15:33.463Z"
          },
          {
